      <h2>Get a Personalized Federal Retirement Analysis</h2>
      <p>
        Online calculators provide helpful estimates, but your unique situation—special provisions, FEHB elections,
        tax planning, TSP allocation, and coordination with Social Security—requires personalized guidance.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our team specializes exclusively in federal employee benefits and retirement planning. We'll help you:
      </p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li>Verify your pension calculations and identify any errors in your official estimate</li>
        <li>Optimize your retirement date to maximize lifetime benefits</li>
        <li>Develop a tax-efficient income strategy coordinating FERS, TSP, and Social Security</li>
        <li>Review survivor benefit elections and insurance needs</li>
        <li>Create a comprehensive retirement income plan tailored to your goals</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/webinars" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Schedule Your Free Analysis</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">Read Our Planning Guides</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
